  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.ChainLinkOASIS v2.0.5\n\nConnects the OASIS to Chainlink -- the industry-standard decentralised oracle network providing tamper-proof data feeds, verifiable randomness (VRF), and Cross-Chain Interoperability Protocol (CCIP). Enables OASIS holons and contracts to consume real-world data and communicate cross-chain. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.4\n- Add read-only ChainLink feed CQL and verified CSharp demo (bc2eea4)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Blockchain/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.ChainLinkOASIS",
